    {
      "id": "mom",
      "contactId": "contact-msec3qoi-ibf5",
      "updatedAt": "",
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "message-msede04e-yfau",
          "from": "contact-msec3qoi-ibf5",
          "text": "下班了吗，儿子",
          "date": "2026-06-08",
          "time": "18:10"
        },
        {
          "id": "message-msedfti6-t73x",
          "from": "player",
          "text": "还没，师傅今天有事情去医院，我替他值个班",
          "date": "2026-06-08",
          "time": "18:11"
        },
        {
          "id": "message-msedgqkt-bv76",
          "from": "contact-msec3qoi-ibf5",
          "text": "好，那你记得吃晚饭。你师傅这么照顾你，你帮帮他也是应该的。",
          "date": "2026-06-08",
          "time": "18:14"
        },
        {
